==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BREAKpoint|Luxray|46}} from the {{TCG|BREAKpoint}} expansion.
*'''Intimidating Fang''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared as a {{TCG|Poké-BODY}} on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Mightyena|10}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
*'''Electric Ball''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Noble Victories|Eelektrik|40}} from {{TCG|Noble Victories}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

